! XRT-04 RT03(据付・変更しない)。バックボーン(L2 だけ・エリア 49.0003)。wide メトリックへ移行済み。
! CORE-B(XR01 向け)は予備リンク= 設計規則どおりメトリック 1000(この機器の側だけ設定済み)。
! IPv6 は単一トポロジ(IOS の既定)。サービス網 10.30.0.0/16 を IS-IS に載せている。
ipv6 unicast-routing
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.3 255.255.255.255
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:255::3/128
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
!
interface Loopback1
 description SERVICES-B
 ip address 10.30.0.1 255.255.0.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:1030::1/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE-B to XR01 (backup)
 ip address 10.0.13.3 255.255.255.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:13::3/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 1000
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to RT02
 ip address 10.0.23.3 255.255.255.0
 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:23::3/64
 ip router isis
 ipv6 router isis
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
router isis
 net 49.0003.0102.5500.0003.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
